@startuml WeClawBotNotify_RefreshSequence

title WeClawBotNotify V1 - 刷新令牌序列图\n(双令牌轮换机制)

actor "用户" as User
participant "Web 管理后台\n(浏览器)" as Web
participant "server/HTTPServer" as API
participant "auth/AccountService" as AccountSvc
participant "jwtx/JWTHelper" as JWTHelper
participant "model/RefreshTokenModel" as RTModel
participant "SQLite" as DB

== 场景：Access Token 过期，前端自动刷新 ==

User -> Web : 操作管理后台\n(如查看通知记录)
activate Web

Web -> API : GET /api/message/list\nAuthorization: Bearer {accessToken}\n(accessToken 已过期)
activate API

API -> API : ClientAuth 验证 Access Token

API --> Web : 401 Unauthorized\n{ code: 100001, msg: "Unauthorized" }
deactivate API

Web -> Web : 拦截器检测到 401\n检查是否有 refreshToken

alt 无 refreshToken
  Web --> User : 跳转到登录页\n"会话已过期，请重新登录"
else 有 refreshToken

  Web -> API : POST /api/auth/refresh\n{ refreshToken: "eyJ..." }
  activate API

  API -> AccountSvc : refreshAccessToken(refreshToken)
  activate AccountSvc

  AccountSvc -> JWTHelper : validateToken(refreshToken)
  activate JWTHelper

  alt Refresh Token 格式无效或签名错误
    JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : error: invalid token
    AccountSvc --> API : error: RefreshTokenInvalid
    API --> Web : 401 { code: 110300, msg: "刷新令牌无效" }
    Web --> User : 跳转到登录页\n"请重新登录"
  else Refresh Token 格式合法

    JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : (token, claims, nil)
    deactivate JWTHelper

    AccountSvc -> AccountSvc : 检查 claims.TokenType == "refresh"

    alt TokenType 不是 refresh
      AccountSvc --> API : error: RefreshTokenInvalid
      API --> Web : 401 { code: 110300, msg: "刷新令牌无效" }
    else TokenType 是 refresh

      AccountSvc -> AccountSvc : 提取 claims.JTI 和 claims.UID

      AccountSvc -> RTModel : findByJTI(ctx, jti)
      activate RTModel
      RTModel -> DB : SELECT * FROM refresh_tokens\nWHERE jti = ?
      activate DB
      DB --> RTModel : RefreshToken | null
      deactivate DB

      alt JTI 不存在 (已使用/已撤销)
        RTModel --> AccountSvc : nil, ErrNotFound
        deactivate RTModel
        AccountSvc --> API : error: RefreshTokenRevoked
        API --> Web : 401 { code: 110301, msg: "刷新令牌已失效" }
        Web --> User : 跳转到登录页\n"请重新登录"
      else JTI 存在

        RTModel --> AccountSvc : &RefreshToken{revoked=0, ...}
        deactivate RTModel

        AccountSvc -> AccountSvc : 检查 revoked == 0

        alt revoked == 1 (已撤销)
          AccountSvc --> API : error: RefreshTokenRevoked
          API --> Web : 401 { code: 110301, msg: "刷新令牌已失效" }
          Web --> User : 跳转到登录页\n"请重新登录"
        else revoked == 0 (有效)

          AccountSvc -> AccountSvc : 检查 expiresAt > now

          alt Refresh Token 已过期
            AccountSvc --> API : error: RefreshTokenExpired
            API --> Web : 401 { code: 110302, msg: "刷新令牌已过期" }
            Web --> User : 跳转到登录页\n"请重新登录"
          else Refresh Token 有效

            note over AccountSvc, RTModel
              Refresh Token 轮换 (Rotation)：
              1. 撤销旧 Refresh Token (revoked=1, 一次性使用)
              2. 生成新的 Access Token + Refresh Token
              3. 存储新 Refresh Token
              防止 Refresh Token 被重放攻击
            end note

            AccountSvc -> RTModel : revokeByJTI(ctx, oldJTI)
            activate RTModel
            RTModel -> DB : UPDATE refresh_tokens\nSET revoked = 1\nWHERE jti = ?
            activate DB
            DB --> RTModel : OK
            deactivate DB
            RTModel --> AccountSvc : nil
            deactivate RTModel

            AccountSvc -> JWTHelper : generateAccessToken(\n  JWTClaims{UID, TokenType=access, newJTI}\n)
            activate JWTHelper
            JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : newAccessToken (短有效期)
            deactivate JWTHelper

            AccountSvc -> JWTHelper : generateRefreshToken(\n  JWTClaims{UID, TokenType=refresh, newJTI}\n)
            activate JWTHelper
            JWTHelper --> AccountSvc : newRefreshToken (长有效期)
            deactivate JWTHelper

            AccountSvc -> RTModel : insert(ctx, &RefreshToken{\n  userId, newJTI, revoked=0, newExpiresAt\n})
            activate RTModel
            RTModel -> DB : INSERT INTO refresh_tokens\n(user_id, jti, revoked, expires_at)\nVALUES (?, ?, 0, ?)
            activate DB
            DB --> RTModel : OK
            deactivate DB
            RTModel --> AccountSvc : nil
            deactivate RTModel

          AccountSvc --> API : TokenPair {\n  newAccessToken,\n  newRefreshToken\n}
          deactivate AccountSvc

          API --> Web : 200 OK\n{\n  token: newAccessToken,\n  refreshToken: newRefreshToken\n}
          deactivate API

          Web -> Web : 更新本地存储\naccessToken = newAccessToken\nrefreshToken = newRefreshToken

          Web -> API : GET /api/message/list\nAuthorization: Bearer {newAccessToken}
          activate API
          API --> Web : 200 OK\n{ list: [...] }
          deactivate API

          Web --> User : 显示通知记录\n(用户无感知，自动完成)
          deactivate Web

        end
      end
    end
  end
end

note over User, DB
  双令牌轮换安全机制：
  1. Refresh Token 一次性使用，用后撤销 (revoked=1)
  2. 每次刷新生成全新的 Token Pair
  3. 旧 Refresh Token 被重放 → 检测到 revoked=1 或 JTI 不存在 → 拒绝
  4. Access Token 短有效期 → 减少泄露风险窗口
  5. Refresh Token 长有效期 → 用户免登录
  6. 撤销而非删除 → 保留审计记录，可追溯异常使用
end note

@enduml
